  "bodyHash": "50b3eca3a9d88f8a",
  "content": "您好<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">海洋生活</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">为您世界的海域增添了数十种独特的鱼类，每种都生活在它们自然的生物群系中。从深海捕食者到平静的河流居民，海洋感觉生机勃勃且多样化。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">设置鱼网自动捕获鱼类，或使用鱼孵化场随着时间的推移进行繁殖。发现新的战利品，或烹饪美味的鱼类主题餐点。您的海洋和河流从未如此充满生机。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">捕鱼陷阱：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">放置在水中并用腐肉诱饵，即可在您忙碌时捕获鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鱼孵化场：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">放置在浅水中，随时间从桶中繁殖鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">新的钓鱼战利品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">找到海盗宝藏、空罐子、鱼骨和化石。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖼️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自定义绘画：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用新的水生主题定制艺术装饰您的世界。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凤尾鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小型咸水鱼，分布在较冷的海洋中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神仙鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">色彩鲜艳的热带淡水鱼，生活在丛林河流和沼泽中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鮟鱇鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">深海底栖生物，出现在黑暗寒冷的海洋深处。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鲈鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">常见的淡水鱼，分布在河流、平原和森林中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🩵 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蓝刺尾鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">色彩鲜艳的礁石鱼类，繁盛于温暖的热带海洋中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雀鳝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">栖息于缓慢流动的河流和沼泽中的淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蝴蝶鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">色彩斑斓的礁石鱼类，分布于温暖的海洋生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鲤鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">强壮耐受的淡水鱼，分布在河流、平原和森林中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鲶鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">生活在河流和沼泽底部的鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">白鲦鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小型淡水鱼，分布于河流和溪流中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💛 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小丑鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿梭于珊瑚礁之间的热带小鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚡ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">电鳐：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">从不同深度的海洋中捕捉的电击性咸水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">金鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">温顺的淡水鱼，分布于河流和池塘中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锦鲤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">华丽的鲤鱼，游弋于河流和樱桃树林中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🩸 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">七鳃鳗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">寄生性鱼类，分布于淡水和咸水区。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">肺鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">依靠空气呼吸，生活在沼泽和丛林中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪸 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蝠鲼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">优雅的海洋巨兽，存在于温带至温暖水域中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小银鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小型鱼类，常见于河流和草原。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">霓虹灯鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">来自丛林河流的热带亮丽鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">北美狗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冷血掠食者，见于泰加湖和河流。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鲈鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">淡水鱼，分布于湖泊、河流和草原。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">梭子鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">河流与林间溪流的淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">食人鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">丛林水域中极具攻击性的掠食者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏜️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">沙漠魚：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">生活在孤立河川中的小型沙漠鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">沙丁鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在寒冷和深层海洋成群生活的咸水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">暹罗斗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">来自丛林与沼泽的色彩斑斓的热带鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🩶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">银线刺鲀：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冰寒海域的冷水河豚。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏖️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">白缘星鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">沙滩潜藏的热带鱼类，活跃于温暖海洋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">黄貂鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">近岸鱼类，分布于温带及热带海域。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鳟鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冷水中栖息的鱼类，见于泰加林溪流和林区。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">金枪鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">大型远洋掠食者，巡游开放水域。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">黑眼鲈鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">北方针叶湖和河流的淡水鱼类。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ 需要客户端安装并需在服务端安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ 需要安装 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a> （Fabric & NeoForge）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ 需要安装 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a>（Fabric）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ 需要安装 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a>（Fabric）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可以直接通过游戏内模组菜单进行配置（需安装由 Prospector 提供的 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a>，适用于 Fabric）。请注意，对于较旧的 Minecraft 版本，也需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\">Forge Config Screens</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件位于 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code> 目录下，文件名为 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>，视配置类型而定。并非所有类型的配置都会存在，有些可能根本没有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 非常感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/joshiejack\">joshiejack</a> 创作的原始 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanted-tooltips\">Piscary</a> 模组，因其拥有丰富多样的新型海洋生物以及精美的细节，如今在现代版 Minecraft 中得到继续发扬。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\">Tamlighter</a> 更新和优化了若干纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/permanent-sponges\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/permanentsponges/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ender-zoology\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-windows\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
